graph LR
    raw[Raw data] --> clean[Clean & dedupe]
    clean --> split{Train/test split}
    split -->|80%| train[Train model]
    split -->|20%| test[Hold-out set]
    train --> eval[Evaluate]
    test --> eval
    eval -->|"accuracy < 0.9"| tune[Tune hyperparameters]
    tune --> train
    eval -->|"accuracy ≥ 0.9"| deploy[Deploy to production]
    deploy --> monitor[Monitor drift]
    monitor -.->|drift detected| raw
